# NOT grpc, unlike porkbun/rabbitmq above). Same "no upstream release,
# no vendorHash recompute without a builder" reasoning as above.
# CVE-2026-39822 / CVE-2026-42505 (Go toolchain, go1.26.4) are the SAME
# two advisories pleme-io/hardened-images already independently verified
# unfixable-via-nixpkgs as of 2026-07-18 (see that repo's own .trivyignore,
